@ref s 597(5) (src:12720-12720)
GIVEN `a warrant has been issued under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the accused appears voluntarily for the offence in respect of which the accused is charged` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 597(5) the warrant is deemed to be executed` MEANS
